{"seq":1,"slug":"options-fundamentals","title":"期权合约基础与收益结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/options-derivatives-pricing/foundations/options-fundamentals","wordCount":2088,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"期权合约基础与收益结构\">期权合约基础与收益结构</h1><p>期权（Option）是金融衍生品中最具灵活性的合约形式。它赋予持有者在特定时间以特定价格买入或卖出标的资产的权利而非义务，这种非对称的权利-义务结构使期权具有独特的非线性收益特征，也使其定价成为量化金融中最具挑战性的问题之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>期权定价的出发点是理解合约本身的结构。以下几个概念贯穿整个定价体系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>权利与义务的非对称性</strong>：买方持有权利（支付权利金），卖方承担义务（收取权利金）——这种非对称性是期权非线性收益的根源</li>\n<li><strong>内在价值与时间价值的分解</strong>：期权价格 = 内在价值（立即行权收益）+ 时间价值（未来可能性溢价）</li>\n<li><strong>看涨-看跌平价</strong>（Put-Call Parity）：同一标的、同一行权价、同一到期日的看涨和看跌期权之间存在确定性的无套利关系</li>\n<li><strong>行权方式决定定价复杂度</strong>：欧式期权有封闭解，美式期权引入最优停时问题，需要数值方法</li>\n<li><strong>期权组合的收益叠加</strong>：复杂策略的收益等于各组成期权收益之和，定价亦然</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"期权合约的基本要素\">期权合约的基本要素</h2><p>一份标准期权合约包含以下核心要素：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>英文术语</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标的资产</td>\n<td>Underlying Asset</td>\n<td>期权合约所对应的基础资产（股票、指数、商品、外汇等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行权价格</td>\n<td>Strike Price (K)</td>\n<td>合约约定的买卖价格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>到期日</td>\n<td>Expiration Date (T)</td>\n<td>合约的有效期限终点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合约类型</td>\n<td>Call / Put</td>\n<td>看涨期权（买入权）/ 看跌期权（卖出权）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权利金</td>\n<td>Premium</td>\n<td>买方为获得权利所支付的价格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合约乘数</td>\n<td>Contract Multiplier</td>\n<td>一张合约对应的标的资产数量（通常为 100）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行权方式</td>\n<td>Exercise Style</td>\n<td>欧式（到期日行权）/ 美式（到期前任意时点）/ 百慕大（特定日期）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>期权的买方（holder）支付权利金获得权利，卖方（writer）收取权利金承担义务。这种非对称性是理解期权定价的关键起点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"看涨与看跌期权的收益结构\">看涨与看跌期权的收益结构</h2><h3 id=\"看涨期权-call-option\">看涨期权（Call Option）</h3><p>看涨期权赋予持有者以行权价 K 买入标的资产的权利。到期时的收益（payoff）为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_T = \\max(S_T - K, 0) = (S_T - K)^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0713em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是到期时标的资产价格。买方的净利润需要减去权利金 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Profit</mtext><mtext>long call</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Profit}_{\\text{long call}} = \\max(S_T - K, 0) - c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Profit</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">long call</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对于看涨期权的卖方：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Profit</mtext><mtext>short call</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Profit}_{\\text{short call}} = c - \\max(S_T - K, 0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Profit</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">short call</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"看跌期权-put-option\">看跌期权（Put Option）</h3><p>看跌期权赋予持有者以行权价 K 卖出标的资产的权利。到期收益为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_T = \\max(K - S_T, 0) = (K - S_T)^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0713em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>买方净利润：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Profit</mtext><mtext>long put</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Profit}_{\\text{long put}} = \\max(K - S_T, 0) - p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Profit</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">long put</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"四种基本头寸的收益对比\">四种基本头寸的收益对比</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[期权四种基本头寸] --&gt; B[买入看涨 Long Call]&#10;    A --&gt; C[卖出看涨 Short Call]&#10;    A --&gt; D[买入看跌 Long Put]&#10;    A --&gt; E[卖出看跌 Short Put]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[最大亏损: 权利金 c]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[最大盈利: 无限]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[最大盈利: 权利金 c]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[最大亏损: 无限]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[最大亏损: 权利金 p]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[最大盈利: K - p]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[最大盈利: 权利金 p]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[最大亏损: K - p]\">flowchart TD\n    A[期权四种基本头寸] --&gt; B[买入看涨 Long Call]\n    A --&gt; C[卖出看涨 Short Call]\n    A --&gt; D[买入看跌 Long Put]\n    A --&gt; E[卖出看跌 Short Put]\n    B --&gt; B1[最大亏损: 权利金 c]\n    B --&gt; B2[最大盈利: 无限]\n    C --&gt; C1[最大盈利: 权利金 c]\n    C --&gt; C2[最大亏损: 无限]\n    D --&gt; D1[最大亏损: 权利金 p]\n    D --&gt; D2[最大盈利: K - p]\n    E --&gt; E1[最大盈利: 权利金 p]\n    E --&gt; E2[最大亏损: K - p]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>头寸</th>\n<th>方向观点</th>\n<th>最大盈利</th>\n<th>最大亏损</th>\n<th>盈亏平衡点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>买入看涨</td>\n<td>看多</td>\n<td>无限</td>\n<td>权利金 c</td>\n<td>K + c</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖出看涨</td>\n<td>看空/中性</td>\n<td>权利金 c</td>\n<td>无限</td>\n<td>K + c</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买入看跌</td>\n<td>看空</td>\n<td>K - p</td>\n<td>权利金 p</td>\n<td>K - p</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖出看跌</td>\n<td>看多/中性</td>\n<td>权利金 p</td>\n<td>K - p</td>\n<td>K - p</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"期权的内在价值与时间价值\">期权的内在价值与时间价值</h2><p>期权的市场价格可以分解为两个组成部分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Option Price</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Intrinsic Value</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Time Value</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Option Price} = \\text{Intrinsic Value} + \\text{Time Value}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Option Price</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Intrinsic Value</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Time Value</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"内在价值-intrinsic-value\">内在价值（Intrinsic Value）</h3><p>内在价值是期权立即行权可获得的收益，反映期权的「实值程度」：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>看涨期权：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">IV = \\max(S - K, 0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>看跌期权：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">IV = \\max(K - S, 0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"时间价值-time-value-extrinsic-value\">时间价值（Time Value / Extrinsic Value）</h3><p>时间价值反映标的资产价格在到期前可能向有利方向移动的「可能性溢价」。影响时间价值的核心因素包括：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>剩余期限</strong>：期限越长，时间价值越高（更多不确定性）</li>\n<li><strong>波动率</strong>：波动率越高，时间价值越高（价格变动幅度更大）</li>\n<li><strong>实值/虚值程度</strong>：平值期权（ATM）时间价值最大</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"期权状态分类\">期权状态分类</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>英文</th>\n<th>看涨期权条件</th>\n<th>看跌期权条件</th>\n<th>内在价值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实值</td>\n<td>In-the-Money (ITM)</td>\n<td>S &gt; K</td>\n<td>S &lt; K</td>\n<td>&gt; 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平值</td>\n<td>At-the-Money (ATM)</td>\n<td>S ≈ K</td>\n<td>S ≈ K</td>\n<td>≈ 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚值</td>\n<td>Out-of-the-Money (OTM)</td>\n<td>S &lt; K</td>\n<td>S &gt; K</td>\n<td>= 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度实值</td>\n<td>Deep ITM</td>\n<td>S &gt;&gt; K</td>\n<td>S &lt;&lt; K</td>\n<td>&gt;&gt; 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度虚值</td>\n<td>Deep OTM</td>\n<td>S &lt;&lt; K</td>\n<td>S &gt;&gt; K</td>\n<td>= 0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"行权方式-欧式-美式与百慕大\">行权方式：欧式、美式与百慕大</h2><h3 id=\"欧式期权-european-option\">欧式期权（European Option）</h3><p>只能在到期日 T 行权。由于行权时点固定，欧式期权的定价相对简单，Black-Scholes 公式最初即针对欧式期权推导。</p>\n<h3 id=\"美式期权-american-option\">美式期权（American Option）</h3><p>可在到期日 T 之前的任何时点行权。美式期权的价值永远不低于同等条件的欧式期权：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>American</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>European</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{American}} \\geq V_{\\text{European}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">American</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">European</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一「早行权溢价」（early exercise premium）使美式期权的定价无法用简单的封闭解公式表达，通常需要二叉树、有限差分或最小二乘蒙特卡洛（LSM）等数值方法。</p>\n<p><strong>美式看涨期权的早行权条件</strong>：对于不付红利的标的资产，美式看涨期权永远不应提前行权（因为时间价值总为正）。但对于付红利的标的，在除息日前可能存在最优提前行权时点。</p>\n<p><strong>美式看跌期权的早行权条件</strong>：当标的价格足够低（深度实值）时，继续持有的时间价值不足以弥补资金的时间成本，此时提前行权可能是最优策略。</p>\n<h3 id=\"百慕大期权-bermudan-option\">百慕大期权（Bermudan Option）</h3><p>可在若干预定日期行权（介于欧式和美式之间），在利率衍生品市场中尤为常见（如 Bermudan swaption）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"看涨-看跌平价关系\">看涨-看跌平价关系</h2><p>Put-Call Parity 是期权定价中最基本的无套利关系，它将同一标的、同一行权价、同一到期日的看涨和看跌期权联系起来：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c + K \\cdot e^{-rT} = p + S_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 为欧式看涨期权价格，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 为欧式看跌期权价格，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 为行权价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 为无风险利率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 为到期时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为当前标的价格。</p>\n<p>这一关系可通过构造两个等价组合来证明：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>组合 A</strong>：买入看涨 + 持有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ke^{-rT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 现金</li>\n<li><strong>组合 B</strong>：买入看跌 + 持有标的资产</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两个组合在到期时无论标的价格如何变动，收益完全相同。因此在无套利条件下，两个组合当前的价值必须相等。</p>\n<p>Put-Call Parity 的实际应用包括：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>已知看涨期权价格推算看跌期权价格（反之亦然）</li>\n<li>检测市场定价偏差，寻找套利机会</li>\n<li>构造合成头寸（synthetic position）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"期权组合策略基础\">期权组合策略基础</h2><p>理解单个期权的收益结构后，可以通过组合构建更复杂的风险-收益特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略名称</th>\n<th>构成</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>牛市价差 Bull Spread</td>\n<td>买低 K call + 卖高 K call</td>\n<td>温和看多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>熊市价差 Bear Spread</td>\n<td>买高 K put + 卖低 K put</td>\n<td>温和看空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨式 Straddle</td>\n<td>买同 K 的 call + put</td>\n<td>预期大幅波动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>宽跨式 Strangle</td>\n<td>买不同 K 的 call + put</td>\n<td>预期大幅波动（成本更低）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蝶式 Butterfly</td>\n<td>买 K1 call + 买 K3 call + 卖 2 份 K2 call</td>\n<td>预期窄幅震荡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铁鹰 Iron Condor</td>\n<td>牛市看跌价差 + 熊市看涨价差</td>\n<td>预期区间震荡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些组合策略的定价本质上是对各个期权分别定价后求和，理解单个期权的定价理论是分析复杂策略的基础。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本文介绍了期权合约的完整基础知识框架。期权的核心特征是非对称的权利-义务结构，由此产生非线性的收益曲线。看涨和看跌期权的四种基本头寸构成了所有期权策略的积木，而 Put-Call Parity 提供了贯穿定价理论的第一个无套利约束。期权的内在价值与时间价值分解揭示了定价需要回答的核心问题：时间价值究竟值多少？行权方式的区别（欧式/美式/百慕大）则决定了定价的数学难度——这些问题将在后续章节的定价模型中逐一解答。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>相关文档</strong>：<a href=\"derivatives-taxonomy\">衍生品分类与市场结构</a> | <a href=\"no-arbitrage-pricing\">无套利定价与风险中性框架</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"期权合约基础与收益结构","id":"期权合约基础与收益结构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"期权合约的基本要素","id":"期权合约的基本要素"},{"level":2,"text":"看涨与看跌期权的收益结构","id":"看涨与看跌期权的收益结构"},{"level":3,"text":"看涨期权（Call Option）","id":"看涨期权-call-option"},{"level":3,"text":"看跌期权（Put Option）","id":"看跌期权-put-option"},{"level":3,"text":"四种基本头寸的收益对比","id":"四种基本头寸的收益对比"},{"level":2,"text":"期权的内在价值与时间价值","id":"期权的内在价值与时间价值"},{"level":3,"text":"内在价值（Intrinsic Value）","id":"内在价值-intrinsic-value"},{"level":3,"text":"时间价值（Time Value / Extrinsic Value）","id":"时间价值-time-value-extrinsic-value"},{"level":3,"text":"期权状态分类","id":"期权状态分类"},{"level":2,"text":"行权方式：欧式、美式与百慕大","id":"行权方式-欧式-美式与百慕大"},{"level":3,"text":"欧式期权（European Option）","id":"欧式期权-european-option"},{"level":3,"text":"美式期权（American Option）","id":"美式期权-american-option"},{"level":3,"text":"百慕大期权（Bermudan Option）","id":"百慕大期权-bermudan-option"},{"level":2,"text":"看涨-看跌平价关系","id":"看涨-看跌平价关系"},{"level":2,"text":"期权组合策略基础","id":"期权组合策略基础"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"衍生品分类体系与市场结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/options-derivatives-pricing/foundations/derivatives-taxonomy"}}